00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,645
When it grabs oxygen instead, RuBP gives one 3-PGA and one useless two-carbon phosphoglycolate.

2
00:00:08,645 --> 00:00:19,700
Salvaging it takes a loop through the chloroplast, the peroxisome and the mitochondrion, and on the way carbon dioxide is lost and ATP is spent, with no gain at all.

3
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,484
This is photorespiration.

